OL,3,ANo collusion in sectarian killing but
OL,4,Amultiple police failings in murder
OL,5,Ainquiry
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn inquiry into the sectarian murder of
OL,8,FRobert Hamill has found police officers
OL,9,Fwho were in a vehicle near the attack
OL,10,Fdid not condone or collude with the
OL,11,Fattackers.
OL,13,FHowever, the inquiry said there were
OL,14,Fmultiple police failings in the
OL,15,Finvestigation, including a tip-off to a
OL,16,Fsuspect to destroy the clothing he wore
OL,17,Fthat night.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
