OL,3,ANo collusion in sectarian killing but
OL,4,Amultiple police failings in murder
OL,5,Ainquiry
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe report, published on Monday,
OL,8,Fhighlighted multiple wrongful omissions
OL,9,Fin the subsequent murder investigation
OL,10,Fincluding a failure to properly search
OL,11,Fthe home of a key suspect.
OL,13,FRobert Hamill was 25 when he died after
OL,14,Fhe was beaten by loyalists in
OL,15,FPortadown, County Armagh in 1997.
